<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:#0D523F;">
  Payment window expired
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888B8B;">
  Reservation released
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  The payment window for order <strong>#{{order_number}}</strong> expired, so we released the reserved items. No charge was completed for this order. If you want to purchase these items again, please place a new order. However, if you already paid for this order, we'll either process it or refund your payment.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Order number" value=order_number}}
  {{> detail-row label="Status" value="Payment expired"}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="Want these items?"}}
  You can place a new order anytime from Dukka. Stock availability may have changed since this reservation ended.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Reply to this email if you believe you already paid for this order.
</p>
